Altar camping is quite dangerous. Do *not* carry a heavy corpse to the
altar with anything else nearby. Instead, leave a weak and slow
monster alive nearby, such as a newt or gas spore. That way, you can
eat little chunks of unicorn (the newt will interrupt your meal
repeatedly) until what's left is a manageable weight for carrying.


